    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are pleased to offer for sale this beautiful, detached home ideally positioned in the small residential enclave of Clybaun Close. \n\nClybaun Close is a quaint cul-de-sac development comprising of just four detached properties with residential parking & encompassed by mature landscaped greenery. \n\nOriginally constructed in 2007, no.2 Clybaun Close is presented in excellent condition throughout having been well maintained & enhanced by the current owners. \n\nThe property offers well proportioned & spacious accommodation with approximately 136.7 sq.m over two stories. \n\nThe ground floor is arranged between a large welcoming hall leading to the front living room with inserted stove & double doors leading to the open plan kitchen-dining area with modern fittings.\n\nThe back of the house is arranged between a separate utility, downstairs bathroom & a downstairs bedrooms. \n\nUpstairs consists of three large bedrooms, two availing of their own en-suites, and a main family bathroom. An attic hatch & stira stairs via the spacious landing provides access to the attic space offering plenty of storage space. \n\nExternally, no.2 Clybaun Close boasts a beautiful private garden with manicured planting, patio space & surrounded by mature greenery. \n\nClybaun Close is a popular residential enclave comprising of all owner occupied residences. \n\nNeatly set back off the Clybaun Road in Knocknacarra, the area is popular due to the host of amenities within walking distance such as Tescos, Clybaun Stores, Tom Sheridans Bar & Gateway Retail Park. \n\nRegular transport links give ease of access to Galway & City Centre, whilst several outdoor landmarks are within easy reach including McGrath's Field & Cappagh Playing Fields. \n\nNo.2 Clybaun Close is a turn-key condition property with an abundance of space giving a buyer the opportunity to secure their new home in a friendly environment & ideal location.\n\nViewing is highly recommended & guaranteed not to disappoint. \n\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \n\nFor Further details please contact our office on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
